argin:0 0 8px 0; color:#666; font-size:0.9em;\">語言: Python | Star: 321,755</p>\n        <p style=\"margin:0 0 10px 0; font-size:0.95em; line-height:1.6;\">彙整了Python生態系統中各類型的優秀工具與函式庫，幫助開發者快速找到適合的解決方案，極大提高開發效率。</p>\n        <p style=\"margin:0; font-size:0.9em;\">\n          <a href=\"https://github.com/vinta/awesome-python\" style=\"color:#007bff; text-decoration:none;\">原始連結</a>\n          &nbsp;|&nbsp;\n          <a href=\"https://github.com/Kevinte67228/AI-Skill/tree/main/寫程式/awesome-python\" style=\"color:#007bff; text-decoration:none;\">本地倉庫路徑</a>\n        </p>\n      </div>\n            \n      <div style=\"background:#f9fafb; border-radius:8px; padding:16px; margin-bottom:14px; border:1px solid #e5e7eb;\">\n        <p style=\"margin:0 0 6px 0;\">\n          <strong style=\"color:#007bff; font-size:1.1em;\">awesome-selfhosted</strong>\n          <span style=\"background:#22c55e; color:#fff; font-size:0.75em; padding:2px 8px; border-radius:10px; margin-left:8px;\">Top Star</span>\n          <span style=\"background:#f97316; color:#fff; font-size:0.75em; padding:2px 8px; border-radius:10px; margin-left:6px;\">🆕 版本更新</span>\n        </p>\n        <p style=\"margin:0 0 8px 0; color:#666; font-size:0.9em;\">語言: Unknown | Star: 320,389</p>\n        <p style=\"margin:0 0 10px 0; font-size:0.95em; line-height:1.6;\">提供了大量可自行部署的開源網路服務與應用程式清單，讓用戶能自由架設並掌控自己的服務，增強資料隱私與客製化彈性。</p>\n        <p style=\"margin:0; font-size:0.9em;\">\n          <a href=\"https://github.com/awesome-selfhosted/awesome-selfhosted\" style=\"color:#007bff; text-decoration:none;\">原始連結</a>\n          &nbsp;|&nbsp;\n          <a href=\"https://github.com/Kevinte67228/AI-Skill/tree/main/寫程式/awesome-selfhosted\" style=\"color:#007bff; text-decoration:none;\">本地倉庫路徑</a>\n        </p>\n      </div>\n            \n      <div style=\"background:#f9fafb; border-radius:8px; padding:16px; margin-bottom:14px; border:1px solid #e5e7eb;\">\n        <p style=\"margin:0 0 6px 0;\">\n          <strong style=\"color:#