font-size:0.9em;\">語言: TypeScript | Star: 390,098</p>\n        <p style=\"margin:0 0 10px 0; font-size:0.95em; line-height:1.6;\">旨在建立一個可在任何作業系統和平台上運作的AI，它能自主執行任務，具備跨平台與實際行動能力，為AI應用帶來創新。</p>\n        <p style=\"margin:0; font-size:0.9em;\">\n          <a href=\"https://github.com/openclaw/openclaw\" style=\"color:#007bff; text-decoration:none;\">原始連結</a>\n          &nbsp;|&nbsp;\n          <a href=\"https://github.com/Kevinte67228/AI-Skill/tree/main/AI Agent/openclaw\" style=\"color:#007bff; text-decoration:none;\">本地倉庫路徑</a>\n        </p>\n      </div>\n            \n      <div style=\"background:#f9fafb; border-radius:8px; padding:16px; margin-bottom:14px; border:1px solid #e5e7eb;\">\n        <p style=\"margin:0 0 6px 0;\">\n          <strong style=\"color:#007bff; font-size:1.1em;\">superpowers</strong>\n          <span style=\"background:#22c55e; color:#fff; font-size:0.75em; padding:2px 8px; border-radius:10px; margin-left:8px;\">Top Star</span>\n          <span style=\"background:#f97316; color:#fff; font-size:0.75em; padding:2px 8px; border-radius:10px; margin-left:6px;\">🆕 版本更新</span>\n        </p>\n        <p style=\"margin:0 0 8px 0; color:#666; font-size:0.9em;\">語言: Shell | Star: 288,825</p>\n        <p style=\"margin:0 0 10px 0; font-size:0.95em; line-height:1.6;\">旨在提供一個有效運作的代理技能框架與軟體開發方法論，協助開發者建構具有自主決策能力的AI代理，提升軟體開發的效率與品質。</p>\n        <p style=\"margin:0; font-size:0.9em;\">\n          <a href=\"https://github.com/obra/superpowers\" style=\"color:#007bff; text-decoration:none;\">原始連結</a>\n          &nbsp;|&nbsp;\n          <a href=\"https://github.com/Kevinte67228/AI-Skill/tree/main/AI Agent/superpowers\" style=\"color:#007bff; text-decoration:none;\">本地倉庫路徑</a>\n        </p>\n      </div>\n            \n      <div style=\"background:#f9fafb; border-radius:8px; padding:16px; margin-bottom:14px; border:1px solid #e5e7eb;\">\n        <p style=\"margin:0 0 6px 0;\">\n          <strong style=\"color:#007bff; font-size:1.1em;\">fast-jev-compaction</strong>\n          <span style=\"background:#3b82f6; color:#fff; font-size:0.75em; padding:2px 8px; border-radius:10px; margin-left:8px;\">Fast-Rising</span>\n          \n        </p>\n        <p style=\"margin:0 0 8px 0; color:#666; font-size:0.9em;\">語言: TypeScript | Star: 4,212</p>\n        <p style=\"margin:0 0 10px 0; font-size:0.95em; line-height:1.6;\">作為Claude Code的插件，它將壓縮摘要替換為Jev決策，能快速評估工具調用並篩選結果，強化AI代理的決策效率和訊息處理能力。</p>\n        <p style=\"margin:0; font-size:0.9em;\">\n          <a href=\"https://github.com/tamaratran/fast-jev-compaction\" style=\"color:#007bff; text-decoration:none;\">原始連結</a>\n          &nbsp;|&nbsp;\n          <a href=\"https://github.com/Kevinte67228/AI-Skill/tree/main/AI Agent/fast-jev-compaction\" style=\"color:#007bff; text-decoration:none;\">本地倉庫路徑</a>\n        </p>\n      </div>\n            \n      <div style=\"background:#f9fafb; border-radius:8px; padding:16px; margin-bottom:14px; border:1px solid #e5e7eb;\">\n        <p style=\"margin:0 0 6px 0;\">\n          <strong style=\"color:#007bff; font-size:1.1em;\">jev-trader</strong>\n          <span style=\"background:#3b82f6; color:#fff; font-size:0.75em; padding:2px 8px; border-radius:10px; margin-left:8px;\">Fast-Rising</span>\n          \n        </p>\n        <p style=\"margin:0 0 8px 0; color:#666; font-size:0.9em;\">語言: TypeScript | Star: 1,247</p>\n        <p style=\"margin:0 0 10px 0; font-size:0.95em; line-height:1.6;\">這是一個基於Jev的AI交易代理，能在每個Monad區塊做出一個交易決策，致力於在加密貨幣市場上實現自動化交易。</p>\n        <p style=\"margin:0; font-size:0.9em;\">\n          <a href=\"https://github.com/jarrodwatts/jev-trader\" style=\"color:#007bff; text-decoration:none;\">原始連結</a>\n          &nbsp;|&nbsp;\n          <a href=\"https://github.com/Kevinte67228/AI-Skill/tree/main/AI Agent/jev-trader\" style=\"color:#007bff; text-decoration:none;\">本地倉庫路徑</a>\n        </p>\n      </div>\n            \n      <div style=\"background:#f9fafb; border-radius:8px; padding:16px; margin-bottom:14px; border:1px solid #e5e7eb;\">\n        <p style=\"margin:0 0 6px 0;\">\n          <strong style=\"color:#007bff; font-size:1.1em;\">jevlike</strong>\n          <span style=\"background:#3b82f6; color:#fff; font-size:0.75em; padding:2px 8px; border-radius:10px; margin-left:8px;\">Fast-Rising</span>\n          \n        </p>\n        <p style=\"margin:0 0 8px 0; color:#666; font-size:0.9em;\">語言: Python | Star: 979</p>\n        <p style=\"margin:0 0 10px 0; font-size:0.95em; line-height:1.6;\">由於缺乏詳細描述，但名稱暗示其與Jev AI系統相關，可能是一個模擬Jev功能或其相關的AI代理工具，用於開發或實驗AI決策模型。</p>\n        <p style=\"margin:0; font-size:0.9em;\">\n          <a href=\"https://github.com/vinnylarouge/jevlike\" style=\"color:#007bff; text-decoration:none;\">原始連結</a>\n          &nbsp;|&nbsp;\n          <a href=\"https://github.com/Kevinte67228/AI-Skill/tree/main/AI Agent/jevlike\" style=\"color:#007bff; text-decoration:none;\">本地倉庫路徑</a>\n        </p>\n      </div>\n            \n      <div style=\"background:#f9fafb; border-radius:8px; padding:16px; margin-bottom:14px; border:1px solid #e5e7eb;\">\n        <p style=\"margin:0 0 6px 0;\">\n          <strong style=\"color:#007bff; font-size:1.1em;\">NanoJev</strong>\n          <span style=\"background:#3b82f6; color:#fff; font-size:0.75em; padding:2px 8px; border-radius:10px; margin-left:8px;\">Fast-Rising</span>\n          \n        </p>\n        <p style=\"margin:0 0 8px 0; color:#666; font-size:0.9em;\">語言: Python | Star: 866</p>\n        <p style=\"margin:0 0 10px 0; font-size:0.95em; line-height:1.6;\">旨在打造一個精簡版的Jev AI代理系統，具備平行決策、動態候選生成能力，並提供完整的端到端訓練管線，用於研究和開發高效能AI代理。</p>\n        <p style=\"margin:0; font-size:0.9em;\">\n          <a href=\"https://github.com/TianyuCodings/NanoJev\" style=\"color:#007bff; text-decoration:none;\">原始連結</a>\n          &nbsp;|&nbsp;\n          <a href=\"https://github.com/Kevinte67228/AI-Skill/tree/main/AI Agent/NanoJev\" style=\"color:#007bff; text-decoration:none;\">本地倉庫路徑</a>\n        </p>\n      </div>\n            \n      <div style=\"backgr